   "negative": "No uniform logos. No readable text on clothing. No stock-photo handshakes. No cheapest. No guaranteed.",
   "positive": "A technician arriving on time at a tidy family home. Front porch of a suburban home in the morning, technician with a tool bag greeting the homeowner at the door. Lighting: Soft morning daylight. Camera: 35mm, eye level, shallow depth of field. Composition: Subject on the left third, open sky on the right for overlays. Offering: Annual maintenance plan \u2014 Two scheduled inspections a year with a fixed quote before any repair work starts. Value: Fixed quote before work starts. Value: Arrival windows you can plan around. Callout: Same-day callout in the service area. Visits: Two inspections a year. Imagery: Real people in real settings, natural light. Brand palette: primary #0B5FFF, accent #FFB000, background #F7F7F5. Leave clean, uncluttered space for the brand logo and exact body, cta, headline overlays; do not render any text, letters or logos in the image.",
